    "paragraphs": [
      "Sun Jan 25, on the road at Rink 1: Globo Gym King Cobras D roll past AlliBladers 6-2. That puts the season at 8-6. That's 4 wins in a row.",
      "Christopher Mayor opened the scoring with 44.4 seconds left in the first, from Jared Chase and Derek Dettman (1-0). Shawn Cash made it 2-0 at 13:18 of the second, from Matthew Killeen. Anthony Ryan Smith made it 3-0 at 9:40 of the second, from Scott Davis and Alex Lam. Matthew Stanchek (AlliBladers) cut it to 3-1 at 8:21 of the second, from Michael Vinarub. Matthew Killeen made it 4-1 at 3:54 of the second, from Tyler Anderson. Anthony Ryan Smith made it 5-1 at 13:39 of the third, from Alex Lam and Matt Goode. Matthew Killeen made it 6-1 at 11:24 of the third on the power play, from Alex Albano. Matthew Stanchek (AlliBladers) cut it to 6-2 at 7:18 of the third, from James Waldron.",
      "Scoring for us: Matthew Killeen (2G 1A), Anthony Ryan Smith (2G) and Alex Lam (2A). Game-winner: Anthony Ryan Smith at 9:40 of the second. 8 PIM on our side (4 minors: Interference, Roughing, Tripping). All-time against AlliBladers: 2-0."
